---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

---
<Base title="Accessibility Statement" description="Hazirminds aims to meet WCAG 2.2 Level AA for hazirminds.ai. Tell us about any problem and we will help.">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(32px,4vw,48px) clamp(24px,4vw,48px) clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px)">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,5vw,64px)"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#585E5A">chevron_right</span><span aria-current="page" style="color:#585E5A">Accessibility Statement</span></nav>
<header style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:clamp(40px,6vw,64px)">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">Legal</p>
<h1 style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.025em;text-wrap:balance">Accessibility Statement</h1>
<p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;text-wrap:pretty">Hazirminds wants everyone, including people with disabilities, to be able to use our website.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#585E5A"><span>Last reviewed: Oct 12, 2026</span></div>
</header>
<div style="display:flex;gap:clamp(40px,6vw,96px);align-items:flex-start">
<aside class="hide-lt960" style="flex:0 0 260px;position:sticky;top:104px;max-height:calc(100vh - 128px);overflow-y:auto"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A;padding:0 12px 8px">On this page</p>
<a class="x1" href="#x1" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">Our goal</a>
<a class="x2" href="#x2" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">What we do</a>
<a class="x3" href="#x3" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">Known limitations</a>
<a class="x4" href="#x4" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">Tell us about a problem</a>
<a class="x5" href="#x5" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">For our clients</a>
</nav></aside>
<article style="flex:1;min-width:0;max-width:760px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:48px">

<section id="x1" aria-labelledby="x1-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="x1-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Our goal</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2, Level AA, for hazirminds.ai.</p>
</section>

<section id="x2" aria-labelledby="x2-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="x2-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">What we do</h2>
<ul style="margin:0;padding-left:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">
<li>Design with readable text, sufficient color contrast and text that can be resized</li>
<li>Support keyboard navigation and screen readers, including on phones</li>
<li>Add text descriptions to meaningful images and labels to form fields and buttons</li>
<li>Offer more than one way to reach us: chat, email and phone</li>
<li>Test new pages and features for accessibility before release</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section id="x3" aria-labelledby="x3-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="x3-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Known limitations</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Some content from third parties, such as embedded maps or scheduling pages, is outside our direct control. If you find anything that's hard to use, please tell us and we'll fix it or help another way.</p>
</section>

<section id="x4" aria-labelledby="x4-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="x4-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Tell us about a problem</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">If anything on our website is hard to use, please let us know and we'll help you get the information or service another way.</p>
<dl style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6">
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 24px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><dt style="flex:1 1 200px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">Email</dt><dd style="flex:2 1 320px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633"><a href="mailto:contact@hazirminds.ai?subject=Accessibility">contact@hazirminds.ai</a> (subject: Accessibility)</dd></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 24px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><dt style="flex:1 1 200px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">Phone</dt><dd style="flex:2 1 320px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633"><a href="tel:+19199247608">919-924-7608</a></dd></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 24px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><dt style="flex:1 1 200px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">Response</dt><dd style="flex:2 1 320px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We aim to respond within 2 business days.</dd></div>
</dl>
</section>

<section id="x5" aria-labelledby="x5-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="x5-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">For our clients</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">We build client websites and AI assistants with these same practices. Each client is responsible for the content it adds to its own site.</p>
</section>

<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding-top:32px;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:15px">Other legal pages</p><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 24px;font-size:16px"><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms">Terms of Use</a><a href="/ai-disclosure">AI Disclosure</a><a href="/free-website-terms">Free Static Website Terms</a></div></div>
</article>
</div>
</div>

</Base>

<style>
.x1:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
.x2:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
.x3:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
.x4:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
.x5:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
</style>
